  "description": "TUnit-native gRPC assertions for .NET tests. Builds on the GrpcAssertions framework-agnostic core (Grpc.Core.Api types). v0.0.1 is a skeleton release that establishes the repository, package identifiers, and quality bar and ships the IsRpcException() discriminator; the full outcome-assertion surface (ThrowsGrpcException and the StatusCode shorthands, plus the GrpcCallBuilder test infrastructure) ships in v0.1.0. AOT-compatible, trimmable, no runtime reflection in the assertion path.",
